GitZip public-download integration notice
=========================================

This directory implements formant's public-repository integration based on
the behavior and user experience of GitZip for github 1.0.5:

  Project: https://github.com/KinoLien/gitzip
  Copyright: KinoLien
  License: MIT (full text in LICENSE)

Modified for formant on 2026-08-12:

* The original token storage, gitzip.org OAuth callback, key synchronization,
  auto-save callback, popup, and action enable/disable behaviors are excluded.
* Only anonymous requests to GitHub's public API are made. This integration
  does not read, write, or transmit a GitHub personal access token.
* The original JSZip and FileSaver browser globals are not included. The
  public-mode content runtime uses browser-native Blob, download anchor,
  CompressionStream, and a small ZIP container writer instead.

For attribution completeness, the upstream GitZip 1.0.5 package also bundled
the following MIT-licensed projects, whose code is not redistributed by this
directory:

