  Pako — Copyright (c) 2014-2017 Vitaly Puzrin and other contributors
  FileSaver.js — Copyright (c) 2016 Eli Grey

Their upstream MIT notices are retained in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES for distributors
evaluating the original GitZip lineage.
